			<name>Es Sider SBM Offshore Loading Buoys</name>
			<description>Role: The 2 offshore Single Buoy Moorings where tankers actually moor &amp; load Es Sider crude (~3 km offshore)
Operator: Waha Oil Co / NOC</description>
